              "value": "The Sea's Revenge"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(curse, divine, necromancy)\n\nA creature that slays a draugr is subjected to a mariner's curse spell with a save DC of 17. The curse ends if the draugr is buried in a calm sea or after 1 week passes."
